            <title>0.14.75</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 26 Jun 2026 11:27:17 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>136</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.75</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The &quot;Allow Corder access&quot; permission wizard is gone. A fresh install now opens straight into the Library and is fully usable with nothing granted; Microphone and Screen Recording are requested on demand, at the moment you record (and Screen Recording only when video capture is on). Previously a nothing-granted Mac was blocked behind the wizard on launch.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
